  "details": "The current naming for VRChat's graphic settings is VRHigh, VRLow and DesktopLow, despite the fact all 3 of them work in both VR and Desktop modes.  I often have to explain to people that they can use DesktopLow in VR.\n\nIt'd be nice to have them marked as Low Medium and High.\n\nIn the best of worlds, there would be an in-game switch.  That way you could immediately see people on lower end computers cry in awe at the gained frames.",
